  "text": "Overseer neutralized. All three processing nodes are down. The Citadel automated defense grid has flatlined. The reinforcement queues just emptied. No fresh drones, no replacement squads. Their machine army has nowhere to go. Containment prisms. Fancy name for a cage. Now look at them. Scrap metal and coolant leaking through every seam. Thermal runaway is accelerating. Feel that vibration? We cannot stay on this deck. Keep moving toward the lift. The Bastion has switched to auxiliary power. We broke its link to the Nexus, but its local guns still work. Heavy footsteps above us. Praetorian mechs and cyber samurai. They know the network is dead. They are making their stand. Ascent lift online. Executive lockout bypassed. Everyone aboard. This takes us straight into the Bastion. Extreme energy readings at the summit. The commander has detected the Nexus collapse. Bastion batteries are cleared to fire. Then we meet them face to face. No more hiding behind machines. Board the lift. Next stop, Apex Bastion.",
